    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Morphing Bullets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a third-person shooter that redefines classic action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just about precise aiming \u2013 your tactical skills determine the outcome as you turn death into an opportunity to shift the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay That Redefines Death</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end \u2013 it's the beginning of a tactical shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your character falls, a unique transformation takes place: Morph into alternative combat forms, such as a mechanical spider sweeping enemies off the ground or a fiery barrier securing key pathways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some morphs last until the end of the match, providing a lasting strategic advantage. Every defeat becomes a stepping stone for a clever comeback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense battles with up to 31 other players \u2013 on your own dedicated server or via Steam\u2019s peer-to-peer mode. Choose your maps, game modes, and battle duration for a customized experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from five unique characters, each with their own playstyle and strengths. Whether you prefer high damage, increased speed, or strong defense, every hero offers tailored advantages to enhance gameplay variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aura Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character possesses an exclusive Aura Skill that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These special abilities are not always available \u2013 they require collecting Aura Points, earned by completing objectives or morphing enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic management of your Aura Points is key \u2013 will you activate a protective team shield or become nearly invisible for a short time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aura Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the power of Aura Weapons \u2013 randomly appearing weapons that provide a tactical edge in heated battles. These unpredictable elements can change the course of a match in crucial moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maps &amp; Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At launch, enjoy three diverse maps and three classic game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit The Bomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture The Target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most Morphs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode offers a unique tactical challenge, ensuring thrilling and varied combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Server-Based Progression System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing goes unrewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Graphics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unity 6 HDRP, Morphing Bullets delivers visual highlights such as Raytracing,\u00a0 dynamic lighting effects, volumetric lights, fog, clouds, and a modern aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access phase follows the motto: &quot;Anything goes, nothing is set in stone.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback directly shapes the game's development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a map feels too small, too big, or just doesn\u2019t fit \u2013 no problem! The game will evolve flexibly to ensure the best possible experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This phase will also be used to implement new features and continuously improve multiplayer code and server stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Morphing Bullets \u2013 A Shooter Beyond Conventional Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic, tactical experience that focuses on pure fun rather than overwhelming statistics. Every defeat is an opportunity for a spectacular comeback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
