morphing enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic management of your Aura Points is key \u2013 will you activate a protective team shield or become nearly invisible for a short time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aura Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the power of Aura Weapons \u2013 randomly appearing weapons that provide a tactical edge in heated battles. These unpredictable elements can change the course of a match in crucial moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maps &amp; Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At launch, enjoy three diverse maps and three classic game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit The Bomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture The Target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most Morphs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode offers a unique tactical challenge, ensuring thrilling and varied combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Server-Based Progression System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing goes unrewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Graphics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unity 6 HDRP, Morphing Bullets delivers visual highlights such as Raytracing,\u00a0 dynamic lighting effects, volumetric lights, fog, clouds, and a modern aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access phase follows the motto: &quot;Anything goes, nothing is set in stone.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback directly shapes the game's development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a map feels too small, too big, or just doesn\u2019t fit \u2013 no problem! The game will evolve flexibly to ensure the best possible experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This phase will also be used to implement new features and continuously improve multiplayer code and server stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Morphing Bullets \u2013 A Shooter Beyond Conventional Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic, tactical experience that focuses on pure fun rather than overwhelming statistics. Every defeat is an opportunity for a spectacular comeback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
